{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55988","headline":"送史长沙 · 陈用拙","name":"送史长沙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人说洞庭波浪险（《广东通志》、《南汉书》作「恶」），使君自有，（《广东通志》、《南汉书》作「身是」）济川舟。\n（见《小草斋诗话》卷四、《粤诗蒐逸》卷一引《连州志》、郑方坤《五代诗话》卷二、同治《广东通志》卷三○三、梁廷柟《南汉书》卷十）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈用拙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55988.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55988","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}